        "table_title": "Table 9.9.3.63.1: NB-S1 DRX parameter information element",
        "columns": [
          "NB-S1 mode DRX value (bits 4 to 1 of octet 3)"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "This field represents the DRX cycle parameter 'T' as defined in 3GPP TS 36.304 [21]."
          ],
          [
            "Bits\n4 3 2 1\n0 0 0 0 DRX value not specified and use cell specific DRX value\n0 0 0 1 DRX cycle parameter T = 32\n0 0 1 0 DRX cycle parameter T = 64\n0 0 1 1 DRX cycle parameter T = 128\n0 1 0 0 DRX cycle parameter T = 256\n0 1 0 1 DRX cycle parameter T = 512\n0 1 1 0 DRX cycle parameter T = 1024"
          ],
          [
            "All other values shall be interpreted as \"DRX value not specified and use cell specific DRX value\" by this version of the protocol."
          ],
          [
            "Bits 5 to 8 of octet 3 are spare and shall be coded as zero."
          ]
        ]
      }
